cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Responsible-AI-evaluation"
abstract: >
  Open-source framework for stress-testing AI systems across bias, toxicity,
  truthfulness, robustness, and adversarial risk dimensions. Built for
  reproducibility, grounded in academic research, and designed for real-world
  governance, risk, and safety use cases aligned with the EU AI Act and
  NIST AI Risk Management Framework.
